                                                "sense_id": "9d682f0f-e95f-3797-9975-8b72b650d7df",
                                                "text": "Southwest, the nation’s largest domestic carrier, is installing seats with less cushion and thinner materials — a svelte model known in the business as “slim-line.”"
                                            }
